{"step": 2, "unit": "src/python/dxpy/dx_extract_utils/retrieve_bins.py::retrieve_bins", "what_it_does": "describes the project and fetches a bin file, probing a file id first and falling back to a dx cat subprocess", "decisions": [{"label": "a", "root_cause": "C8.S4", "lines": [12], "verdict": "accepted", "why": "The project is described on every call, and somatic_filter_payload calls retrieve_geno_bins up to three times per query. Only project_desc['region'] is used, so a cache of region per project removes the repeats. Network-bound."}, {"label": "b", "root_cause": "C9.S1", "lines": [23, 33, 34, 35], "verdict": "rejected", "why": "The describe at 23 is the probe that selects the staging-manifest branch by raising ResourceNotFound. Dropping it changes which branch runs, so it is an existence check, not discarded work."}]}
