{"step": 2, "unit": "src/python/dxpy/cli/workflow.py::update_stage", "what_it_does": "updates a workflow stage, fetching the workflow's edit version before the no-op early return", "decisions": [{"label": "a", "root_cause": "C1.S6", "lines": [213, 220, 221, 222, 223, 224], "verdict": "accepted", "why": "dxworkflow.editVersion at 213 triggers a describe on a fresh handler, but initial_edit_version is read only at 263, after the early return at 220-224. Moving the read after the early return skips the describe when no update is requested. Network-bound."}]}
